  "goodToKnow": "Die Leichtathletik is athletics or track and field: running, jumping and throwing events. Literally, it's light athletics, as opposed to die Schwerathletik (weightlifting, wrestling). Der Leichtathlet (die Leichtathletin) is an athlete. Many German children take part in the Bundesjugendspiele, a school sports day with athletics events and certificates, which some love and others dread. Leichtathletik-WM is the world championships."
